    A short website intro to generics
  </is>
  <documentation>
    Structuring skeleton for the “Generics briefly” documentation page. Planned scopes: generics, declaring Block parameters, generic type arguments. Purpose and detailLevel are derived from the a01 BmlDocSetPlan PagePlan docs.GenericsBriefly. This skeleton carries page identity, properties, and authoritative-source references only; sections and prose are authored in the a03 stage.
